WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.811
- Hi Jonah.

00:00:02.811 --> 00:00:05.480
- Hi Drew, it's wonderful
to see you again.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.950
How are you?
- Oh, Jonah,

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:10.150
I can't have a week go by
where we're not hanging out.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:13.500
I mean, since 2019 and you and I decided

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.900
to go on this journey together,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:17.050
I am just so thrilled to be here.

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.290
Okay, Jonah, let's get
right into the news.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.446
You have some T-Rex information?

00:00:21.446 --> 00:00:25.130
- Oh yes, today I'm reporting on a story

00:00:25.130 --> 00:00:29.110
that there's now a dinosaur named Stan,

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:33.370
and he is the most complete
T-Rex fossil that there is,

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.870
and is actually in Rockefeller Center.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.480
And it's about to auction on October 6th

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:43.456
for six to $8 million,
and I really want it.

00:00:43.456 --> 00:00:45.474
(Drew laughs)

00:00:45.474 --> 00:00:48.680
I did the math, and it
would take 35,000 afghans

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:51.320
by October 6th, but I really want it.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:55.747
So could you take a picture of
it for me and send it to me?

00:00:55.747 --> 00:00:57.810
Since it's right there
in Rockefeller center?

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.860
- Yeah, I'll make a phone
call and see if we can get in.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:03.010
And at the very least, do that.

00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:05.200
maybe I'll just try and I don't know,

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.690
I'll see what kind of deal I can work,

00:01:06.690 --> 00:01:09.650
but that is a hefty price tag, my God.

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.731
All right, in other news...

00:01:11.731 --> 00:01:12.820
And I want to get you

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.590
everything you want, Jonah, gosh darn it.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.150
All right, I'm gonna see what I can do,

00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:18.340
picture-wise at least.

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:19.780
All right, some talented woodworkers

00:01:19.780 --> 00:01:21.630
are building and giving desks to kids.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:23.203
What do you know about this?

00:01:23.203 --> 00:01:27.070
- Oh yeah, this has been
trending all over the country.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:28.803
There's woodworkers that
are now making desks

00:01:28.803 --> 00:01:31.320
for kids and donating them to them.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:33.500
And that is so important,

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.350
because as a virtual learner myself,

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:41.060
and as so many others are
right now, you need a workspace

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:43.200
your own space to do your school.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.180
And I'm finishing this story off

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.490
by letting you know that I love it

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:51.680
when I see under another fellow
human using their handicraft

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:54.070
and their talent to do good for others,

00:01:54.070 --> 00:01:56.790
like I do with my crochet.

00:01:56.790 --> 00:02:00.428
- I love you Jonah, I
really do, and I agree.

00:02:00.428 --> 00:02:02.840
(audience claps)

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:05.580
And we talk so much
about education, Jonah.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:09.856
And so the fact that these
craftsmen are doing this

00:02:09.856 --> 00:02:12.890
for the sake of education, I just,

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:17.460
I know that's a big priority for us.

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:21.053
Okay, you're a crocheting
prodigy, obviously.

00:02:21.937 --> 00:02:24.635
What's going on in the crochet news world?

00:02:24.635 --> 00:02:28.020
- Well, there's two
stories I'm reporting on.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.940
But the first one is
about "The Golden Girls".

00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:32.760
There's now a "Golden Girls" book

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:35.530
where you can crochet "The Golden Girls".

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:38.080
And the one I have my eye on making

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:42.780
is Sophia because she is my
favorite, because she knits.

00:02:42.780 --> 00:02:45.270
I mean, I'm primarily a crocheter,

00:02:45.270 --> 00:02:47.650
but I do respect those knitters.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:49.430
- Yeah, absolutely, and you know what?

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:52.830
Fun fact, I think she
was the youngest person

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:54.440
and played the oldest, right?

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.990
Estelle Getty.

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.090
Yeah, she was actually the
youngest cast member in age,

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:03.130
but played the oldest lady of the group.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:07.250
Okay, and in other crochet
news, is there one more crochet?

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:08.083
- Oh-
- By the way,

00:03:08.083 --> 00:03:13.010
this really gets the lisp in
me, crochet kitty couches.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:18.360
- Oh yes, this is a big-breaking
news story that's totally-

00:03:18.360 --> 00:03:20.168
- I can't wait, bring it on!

00:03:20.168 --> 00:03:23.850
- So right now, everybody's
making kitty couches.

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:27.770
And it was originally a pattern
that was made 30 years ago

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.660
by my pattern book publisher,
Annie's and the Soul Bouquet.

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:34.340
But in the past couple
months it went crazy.

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:36.540
It went viral on the internet,

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:38.320
and now everybody's making them.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.510
And I had a request to make one

00:03:40.510 --> 00:03:43.690
for people from my Instagram,
thousands of requests.

00:03:43.690 --> 00:03:45.920
- Really?
- And I never had the time.

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:49.350
But now, I made one and I'm
here to reveal it to you

00:03:49.350 --> 00:03:51.020
for the first time.
- And this is a first.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:52.470
This has never been seen before.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:56.796
This is Jonah's like premiere kitty couch.

00:03:56.796 --> 00:03:58.836
(audience cheers)

00:03:58.836 --> 00:04:00.580
Oh my gosh!

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:03.640
Jonah, can I get in line
with the thousands of people?

00:04:03.640 --> 00:04:06.840
'Cause we have our two
cats, Lucky and Peach, and-

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:09.110
- Oh, I was just gonna
ask if you had a cat,

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.312
but if you genuinely like
it, you could have it.

00:04:12.312 --> 00:04:14.320
(audience cheers)

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:15.763
- Are you serious, Jonah?

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:17.930
- Yep, it will be a trade off.

00:04:17.930 --> 00:04:20.760
I get my dinosaur picture,
and you get the cat couch.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.590
- Oh my god, Jonah, I'm so excited!

00:04:22.590 --> 00:04:24.500
Okay, until next week,

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:27.720
and we're doing some
really amazing reviews

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:31.650
on movies that we both
love, and I can't wait.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:34.770
And until next week,
Jonah, I will be waiting,

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:37.380
Lucky and Peach, that is a throne.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:41.140
That is the most fabulous
in cat accoutrement.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:44.307
Oh my gosh, thank you, Jonah, I love you.

00:04:44.307 --> 00:04:46.890
(upbeat music)

